              "text": "obruō, obruere — \"to overwhelm, to bury\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Tempestās nautās obruit. The storm overwhelmed the sailors."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "obruō, obruere, obruī, obrutum: ob + ruō, to rush over. Also of earth and ash: a town buried under ash."
            }
