          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "obruō is built on ruō, \"to rush, to fall\", with ob- (EtymDB): to fall upon and cover over."
